OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 15 MAR
OL,4,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,5,     GJoin Sarah Walker for three hours
OL,6,     Gof classical music and a gentle,
OL,7,     Guplifting soundtrack for this
OL,8,     GMothering Sunday.
OL,9,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,10,     GGeorge Saunders, a Booker Prize-
OL,11,     Gwinning novelist and master of
OL,12,     Gthe short-story form, shares his
OL,13,     Gmusical choices with Michael
OL,14,     GBerkeley.
OL,15,G1330FMusic Map
OL,16,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores one of
OL,17,     Gthe most recognisable pieces of
OL,18,     Gclassical music, Samuel Barber's
OL,19,     GAdagio for Strings.
